</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.28</h2><ul><li><strong>The Token window gives output speed its own section.</strong> The Token spend window beside the usage card lists the selected span&#x27;s average and each timed model&#x27;s speed in tok/s, with first-token latency beside that model when a log recorded it, and no longer writes Partial estimate or an explanation under the totals. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/90">#90</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.28">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
